   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\"\"\"Writes exp_book.ipynb to the wnn_connectome_starterpack directory.\"\"\"\n",
    "import json, pathlib\n",
    "\n",
    "cells = []\n",
    "\n",
    "def md(*lines):\n",
    "    cells.append({\"cell_type\": \"markdown\", \"metadata\": {}, \"source\": list(lines)})\n",
    "\n",
    "def code(*lines):\n",
    "    cells.append({\"cell_type\": \"code\", \"execution_count\": None, \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "                  \"outputs\": [], \"source\": list(lines)})"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3c40b8c3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🧠 Alpha Connectome (Wunder RNN) — Exploratory Data Analysis\\n,\n",
    "**Run each cell one at a time.** Every cell is small and fast.,\n",
    "> ⚠️ NEVER call `pd.read_parquet()` on the full files — train is **29 GB**, valid is **5.6 GB**.,\n",
    "> Always use `ParquetFile.read_row_group(i)` to load **one sequence (20 000 rows)** at a time.\\n\",\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "    \"| File | Sequences | Rows |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"|------|----------:|-----:|\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `train.parquet` | 10 607 | 212 140 000 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `valid.parquet` | 1 873 | 37 460 000 |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| `valid_mask.parquet` | 1 873 | 37 460 000 |\\n\","
   ]
  },
  {
